---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import ProfileImage from '../assets/JDonoghue.png';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><BaseHead title="About · Field Notes" description="The story behind Field Notes." /></head><body><Header /><main class="about"><section class="about-intro"><p class="eyebrow">About this notebook</p><h1>A place to<br /><em>think out loud.</em></h1><p class="lead">I'm Jack, and Field Notes is a living record of the things I am learning, building, and returning to.</p></section><section class="about-grid"><div class="about-aside"><img class="profile-image" src={ProfileImage.src} alt="Jack Donoghue" /><span class="aside-mark">JD</span><p>Curiosity is a practice, not a personality trait.</p></div><div class="prose"><p>These notes sit somewhere between a lab book and a sketchbook. They follow the process behind the finished thing: the useful detours, the stubborn bugs, the small discoveries, and the questions that keep getting better.</p><p>The work here moves between DevOps, creative technology, and music. Different tools, same instinct: make something, pay attention, then make it a little more useful.</p><p>Thanks for stopping by. I hope you find an idea worth carrying with you.</p></div></section></main><Footer /></body></html>
<style>.about-intro{padding:25px 0 80px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.about-intro h1{margin:18px 0 24px}.about-intro h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--orange)}.lead{max-width:530px;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.2rem}.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;gap:100px;padding-top:75px}.about-aside{color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem}.profile-image{width:170px;height:210px;object-fit:cover;object-position:top;border-radius:22px;margin-bottom:18px}.aside-mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:100px;height:100px;border-radius:24px;background:var(--deep);color:var(--lime);font:500 25px 'DM Mono',monospace;margin-bottom:22px}.about .prose{margin:0}@media(max-width:760px){.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:35px;padding-top:48px}}
</style>

